# Cloudinary Account Provisioning Java SDK

Speakeasy-generated Java SDK for the Cloudinary Provisioning and Permissions APIs.

## Architecture

- **Generated code** (`src/main/java/com/cloudinary/account/provisioning/`): regenerated by `speakeasy run` — do NOT edit
- **Custom hooks** (`src/main/java/com/cloudinary/account/provisioning/hooks/`): manually maintained — safe to edit (auth, config)
- **Config** (`.speakeasy/workflow.yaml`, `.speakeasy/gen.yaml`): controls generation behavior
- **Overlays** (`.speakeasy/speakeasy-modifications-overlay.yaml`): OpenAPI schema modifications

## Key commands

- `speakeasy run` — regenerate SDK from OpenAPI schema
- `./gradlew build -x test` — build the package
- `./gradlew test` — run tests

## SDK resources

ProductEnvironments, Users, UserGroups, AccessKeys, BillingUsage, Roles, Principals, CustomPolicies, EffectivePolicies, SystemPolicies, Public

